== Description ==

'''Tungsten Ingot''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 22 downstream recipes at 4 different workbenches, including [[Tungsten steel alloy]], [[Tungsten Buckshot]], [[Laser Trap]], [[Tungsten Steel Knife]], [[Tungsten Bullet Tip]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

